ok 1 - finds a value in an array with one element
ok 2 - finds a value in the middle of an array
ok 3 - finds a value at the beginning of an array
ok 4 - finds a value at the end of an array
ok 5 - finds a value in an array of odd length
ok 6 - finds a value in an array of even length
ok 7 - identifies that a value is not included in the array
ok 8 - a value smaller than the array's smallest value is not found
ok 9 - a value larger than the array's largest value is not found
ok 10 - nothing is found in an empty array
ok 11 - nothing is found when the left and right bounds cross
1..11
